            "text": "\r\n<div id=\"stockHolding\">\r\n\t<div class=\"functionBar\">\r\n\t   <div dojoType=\"dijit.form.Form\" id=\"stockHoldingForm\" name=\"stockHoldingForm\" action=\"client\" jsId=\"stockHoldingForm\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" onSubmit=\"return false;\">\r\n\t  \t\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"_atrad_action\" name=\"action\" value =\"getStockHolding\"/>\r\n\t    \t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"stockHolding_exchange\" name=\"exchange\" value =\"\"/>\r\n\t    \t<input type=\"hidden\" id =\"stockHolding_broker\" name=\"broker\" value =\"\"/>\r\n\t    \t<input type=\"hidden\" id =\"stockHolding_format\" name=\"format\" value =\"\"/>  \t\r\n\t  \t\t<table width=\"900px\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"blueText\">\r\n\t  \t\t  <tr>\r\n\t    \t\t  <td width=\"73\" align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\"><div id=\"lbstockHoldingAccount\" atLangID=\"javascriptStockHoldingAccNo\"></div></td>\r\n\t    \t\t  <td width=\"5\" align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 5px;\">:</td>\r\n\t     \t\t  <td width=\"200\" align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n\t\t     \t\t  <select id=\"stockHoldingClientAccount\" name=\"stockHoldingClientAccount\" dojoType=\"dijit.form.ComboBox\" autoComplete=\"false\" style=\"width:250px; \" >           \t\t\r\n\t\t       \t\t  </select>\r\n\t       \t\t  </td>\r\n\t    \t\t  <td width=\"30\" align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t    \t\t  <td width=\"45\" align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\"><div id=\"lbstockHoldingSecurity\" atLangID=\"javascriptStockHoldingSecurity\"></div></td>\r\n\t    \t\t  <td width=\"5\" align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 5px;\">:</td>\r\n\t     \t\t  <td width=\"200\" align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n\t\t     \t\t  <select id=\"stockHoldingSecurity\" name=\"stockHoldingSecurity\" dojoType=\"dijit.form.ComboBox\" autoComplete=\"false\" style=\"width:230px; \" >           \t\t\r\n\t\t       \t\t  </select>\r\n\t       \t\t  </td>\r\n\t              <td></td>\r\n\t              <!--  \r\n\t              <td align=\"right\" width=\"120px\">              \r\n\t\t              <button data-dojo-type=\"dijit.form.Button\" id=\"stockHoldingRefreshbtn\" >Refresh</button>\r\n\t\t              <div dojoType=\"dijit.form.Button\" id=\"printStockHolding\" title=\"Print\"></div>\r\n\t\t              <div dojoType=\"dijit.form.Button\" id=\"saveStockHolding\" title=\"Save\"></div>\t              \r\n\t              </td>\r\n\t              -->\r\n\t              <td width=\"100px\"></td>\r\n\t              <td align=\"right\">              \r\n\t\t              <button data-dojo-type=\"dijit.form.Button\" id=\"stockHoldingRefreshbtn\" >Refresh</button>\r\n\t\t              <div dojoType=\"dijit.form.Button\" id=\"printStockHolding\" title=\"Print\"></div>\r\n\t\t              <div dojoType=\"dijit.form.Button\" id=\"saveStockHolding\" title=\"Save\"></div>\t              \r\n\t              </td>\r\n\t          </tr>\r\n\t   \t \t</table>  \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\r\n\t<div class=\"popupBody\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"gridBg\">\r\n\t\t    <div id=\"stockHoldingDataGrid\" style=\"width:750px;height:310px\" dojoType=\"dijit.layout.ContentPane\"></div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"popFooter\">\r\n\t\t\t<table>\r\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blueText note\" width=\"831\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t*The average cost and <span>gain/loss</span> in this statement are indicative figures as the cost of the following transaction types may have not been captured in the calculation\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\t<table>\r\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"blueText note2\" width=\"820\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t*Warrants&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Right issues&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Splits&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Subdivisions&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Bonus issues&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Intra transfer&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*Share lodgments\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<td width=\"73\" align=\"right\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button dojoType=\"dijit.form.Button\" name =\"close\" id=\"btnStockHoldingClose\"  atLangID=\"javascriptStockHoldingcloseBtn\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tClose</button>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"blueText\" style=\"float:left\" id=\"stockHoldingRefreshbtn\" atLangID=\"javascriptBlotterLstRefreshTime\" >Last Refresh Time: </div><div id=\"bLstStockRefreshTime\" class=\"blueText\" style=\"float:left\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\r\n\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>"
